Location: internal/handlers/dashboard/period.go:32.
The new comparison=year override compares raw active.MinDate()/MaxDate()
instants with midnight-normalized previous civil bounds. A first transaction
at noon on the first prior day spuriously makes HistoryAvailable=false.

